{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"carpet-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"carpet-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["carpet-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Kalkulator membagi dimensi ruangan di sepanjang gulungan dengan lebar gulungan, memutar ke atas hingga potongan-potongan penuh dan dikalikan dengan panjang setiap potongan. Pilih apakah tumpukan harus berjalan sepanjang panjang atau lebar ruangan, atau biarkan alat membandingkan kedua arah.","record_id":"daa0c20d2aa1638580a988f8d76544ec1c01409ebf0e6734f4d141c11573ea40","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":0.8462354549999986,"source":"The calculator divides the room dimension across the roll by the roll width, rounds up to whole cuts and multiplies by the length of each cut. Choose whether the pile should run along the room length or width, or let the tool compare both directions.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"29f948fcae829df28f58d01648591bd0b69b58f2043e297312f4ad028edba598","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Kalkulator membagi dimensi ruangan di sepanjang gulungan dengan lebar gulungan, memutar ke atas hingga potongan-potongan penuh dan dikalikan dengan panjang setiap potongan. Pilih apakah tumpukan harus berjalan sepanjang panjang atau lebar ruangan, atau biarkan alat membandingkan kedua arah.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
